    "chunk_text": "PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 29.07.2025 4A\n\nSouth : Lands bearing Assessment Nos.38 and 37A on Old Kesbewa Road and Lot CC of this tracing;West: Lots CC, CB and CA\n\n07. Lot CG \u2013 Assessment No. 39A(a portion) Old Kesbewa Road \u2013 Extent: 0.0010 Hectare North: Lots CF, CE and CD; East : Lot CD, Lands bearing Assessment Nos.39 and 39A on Old Kesbewa Road; South: Lands bearing Assessment Nos.39A and 47 on Old Kesbewa Road, Lot CH; West: Lots CH, CI and CF\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\n08. Lot CL \u2013 Assessment No. 61/4 (a portion) Old Kesbewa Road \u2013 Extent: 0.0019 Hectare North : Lots CM, CJ and CK; East : Lot CK, Lands bearing Assessment Nos.63/3 and 61/4 on Old Kesbewa Road; South : Lands bearing Assessment 61/4 and 61/5 on Old Kesbewa Road, Lot CO; West: Lots CO, CN and CM\n\n09. Lot CO \u2013 Assessment No. 61/5 (a portion) Old Kesbewa Road \u2013 Extent: 0.0018 Hectare North : Lots CN, CM and CL; East : Lot CL, Lands bearing Assessment Nos.61/4 and 61/5 on Old Kesbewa Road; South: Land bearing Assessment No.61/5 on Old Kesbewa Road and Manel Mawatha; West : Manel Mawatha and Lot CN\n\nECG 07-0353"
