    "chunk_text": "1AI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.05.09PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 09.05.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2447/51 \u2013 2025 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u02a4\u0dc3\u0dca\u01b1 \u0db8\u0dc3 01 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0286\u00fd\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.08.01\n\nNo. 2447/51 \u2013 FRIDAY, AUGUST 01, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I: SECTION (I) \u2013 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Noti\ufb01cations\n\nSPECIAL ALLOWANCE PAYABLE TO WORKERS IN THE COCOA, CARDAMOM AND PEPPER GROWING AND MANUFACTURING TRADE\n\nIT is hereby noti\ufb01ed, under Section 20(2)(b) of the Wages Boards Ordinance (Chapter 136), that the Cost of Living Index Number for the above trade for the month of May 2025, being 214.80 the special allowance in respect of a normal working day in the month of June 2025 will be as follows:-\n\nThe Cocoa, Cardamom and Pepper Growing and Manufacturing TradeThe Cocoa, Cardamom and Pepper Growing and Manufacturing Trade\n\nClass of Workers Special Allowance for a Normal Working Day Rs. C.\n\nDaily Paid Employees:\n\nWorkers 1885.22\n\nH. M. D. N. K. WATALIYADDA, Commissioner of Labour.\n\nDepartment of Labour,Colombo 05,28th July, 2025.\n\nEOG 08-0001\n\n1A \u2013 G 045009\u2013 19 (08/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
