use : Home Garden, a part of a permanent building is available; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Could not be traced; Extent: 0.0001 Hectare.\n\n03. Lot No. 03 Name of the Land: \u2014; Present land use : Cement drain Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Could not be traced; Extent: 0.0001 Hectare.\n\n04. Lot No. 04 Name of the Land: \u2014; Present land use : Cement drain; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Could not be traced; Extent: 0.0004 Hectare."
