    "chunk_text": "\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2447/62 - 2025 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u0ddd\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dc3 01 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.08.01\n\nNo. 2447/62 \u2013 FRIDAY, AUGUST 01, 2025\n\nPART III - LANDS Title Registration\n\nRegistration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998 (Section 12) NOTICE No : 92/0016 KILINOCHCHI DISTRICT IT is hereby notified that any person having a claim to the ownership or possession or interest to one or more of the parcels of lands reflected in the Cadastral Map No. 920011 made by the Surveyor-General under Section 11 of the Registration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998 relating to the village of Rathinapuram (Block 04, Sheet No. 01) or any part thereof, situated within the Grama Niladhari Division of No.KN22 - Rathinapuram in the Divisional Secretariat Division of Karachchi in the District of Kilinochchi in the Province of Nothern should submit his claim to the undersigned before 11th of August 2025 In the event of failure to submit any claim before the above-mentioned date, action will be taken to hold an exparte inquiry to determine title to the land and accordingly publish such determination in the Government Gazette in terms of Section 14 of the above Act. The Cadastral Map No. 920011 referred to above may be perused at the relevant Grama Niladhari Office, Divisional Secretariat, District Survey Office, Office of the Commissioner of Title Settlement, or the Surveyor - General\u2019s office. Further information may be obtained from the Grama Niladhari, the Divisional Secretary, or the Commissioner of Title Settlement.\n\nP.C.D. SIGERA, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement.\n\nLand Title Settlement Department, No.1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 11th July, 2025. EOG 08 - 0012/2\n\nNOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO LAND PARCELS"
