    "chunk_text": "NOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO LAND PARCELS Registration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998 (Section 12) NOTICE No : 61/0389 Kegalle District IT is hereby notified that any person having a claim to the ownership or possession or interest to one or more of the parcels of lands reflected in the Cadastral Map No. 610239 made by the Surveyor-General under Section 11 of the Registration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998 relating to the village of Waawaladeniya Division NO 04 Waawaladeniya (Within Kegalle Municipal Council Area) (Block 03, Sheet No. 05) or any part thereof, situated within the Grama Niladhari Division of No.51A - Ranwala in the Divisional Secretariat Division of Kegalle in the District of Kegalle in the Province of Sabaragamuwa should submit his claim to the undersigned before 11th of August 2025 In the event of failure to submit any claim before the above-mentioned date, action will be taken to hold an ex parte inquiry to"
  },
